        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "(2) On the payment of such sum of money to such officer, the suspected person, if in custody, shall be discharged and no further proceedings in respect of the offence shall be taken against such person."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5c9f139529d6450e9916c9be83393f86_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "(3) The sum of money accepted or agreed to be accepted as composition under sub section (1),\nshall not be more than one lakh rupees and due regard shall be made to the guidelines specified in section 49: Provided that no offence, for which "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0890f745970744d48c66ed48299ee9a2_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nBased on the said provision, the Commissioner of Food Safety had issued the order dated 04.01.2024 revising the compounding penalty."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "211f798b2f254e9982336a7a130ff5f0_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It states that if the offence is committed for the second time, the compounding penalty will be Rs.50,000/-."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9f72b083e9f84112b39cd9e1693ecf42_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Section 68 of the Act is clear to the effect that if imprisonment has been prescribed, then it cannot be compounded."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e8b1a02a6653431e8cdaf914442c72ac_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this case, the petitioner has been arrested for the offence under Section 328 of IPC."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6f01885863664e6ca74c8f18d98b2d3f_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It provides for imprisonment."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "90774aacfabc4ea4ab0851372bb41b77_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nIt cannot be compounded."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "75d230491d3a434bb7d9bd664290b69e_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "What can be compounded is only an offence registered under FSSA."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fb5e9ab24d364eb18c06cb3cf09a6b84_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nSince no case has been registered against the petitioner for having committed an offence under FSSA, the question of compounding does not arise at all."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "08a1a3efe3444613b8d6f5e9ba665e8e_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In any event, the petitioner cannot be compelled to compound the offence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b6774883d0fd432098b66d0af87dd121_31",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is open to the petitioner to pay a sum of Rs.50,000/- and avoid prosecution under the Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "22e856c1438a464ba96620eef41cd343_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the alternative, he can face the prosecution."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0abd86ea20e94ca297659c012e4401d8_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this case, the petitioner is already facing prosecution and he https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis was also arrested."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "817df51bf6f249db9111b5bf24c97239_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nTherefore, the petitioner will not stand to gain by remitting a sum of Rs.50,000/-."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "27926e5fa0de4cf5b8d3f9824b902631_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As regards the sealing of the premises, I had already held that failure to adhere to the procedure contemplated in Section 38(1)(c) of the Act or the proviso thereto can be the only reason for sealing the premises."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cf24cb83e6c643c792e6c4becedce714_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this case, the petitioner was very much present."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "66738a81e3d444319aecf37ce40d224f_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has extended his cooperation."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ae42ed0e01c3476caea4e2a8a0cd7cb1_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He was arrested only on 29.06.2024."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5f51a315109f4404b712d72fe1ac829a_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "When the impugned order was passed for sealing the premises, the petitioner was in prison."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "347ff36b4a8546dd817fb67a7b5c8de6_40",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It was done without notice to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c2a21ef939804d62bf534545731b4189_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Applying the principle of proportionality, I hold that the continued sealing of the petitioner's premises is clearly unreasonable."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "804439144f6641af93660dabb8403229_44",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this view of the matter, the respondent is directed to de-seal the premises forthwith and without any delay."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "44108fbfb0d74f378ae54ce30aa4de83_45",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The respondent is of-course at liberty to prosecute the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2de742e6d14d4c348610222e0fa6aba0_46",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
